1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,720
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,760
=Episode 9=

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,720
(Concubine Rou, whose side are you on?)

4
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:26,760
Congratulations, Your Highness,
on receiving the Imperial Seal

5
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,160
and ruling the harem.

6
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,480
Rise. Be seated.

7
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,240
Thank you, Your Highness.

8
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,840
No need for formalities.

9
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,680
As for how I came to rule the harem,

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
I owe it to your help.

11
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,760
You flatter us, Your Highness.

12
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:48,560
You brought in a master
from the Huguo Temple.

13
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:50,520
Even the Empress Dowager
believed it.

14
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,080
Without that,

15
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,760
I could never have cleared my name.

16
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:57,240
Noble Consort Hui would have
framed me for sure.

17
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,600
I should be thanking you.

18
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:01,120
You are wise and gifted.

19
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:04,240
You should have ruled the harem
long ago.

20
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:07,240
I only did my duty.

21
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:10,360
Noble Consort Hui
brought this on herself.

22
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:13,800
Her own greed was her undoing.

23
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,520
But you, Rong...

24
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:18,080
You stayed calm in a crisis,

25
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:18,920
and handled it with ease.

26
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:22,000
I must say, you've impressed me.

27
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,920
You flatter me, Your Highness.

28
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:28,400
I'm not worthy of such praise.

29
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:31,160
Now that you rule the harem,

30
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:33,160
if you ever need my help,

31
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,480
I will do

32
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,200
all I can.

33
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:43,840
Second prince!

34
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,560
Please slow down, Your Highness!

35
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:46,440
Your Highness!

36
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:52,400
(The second prince,
Noble Consort Hui's son)

37
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:54,440
You maids are so annoying.

38
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,560
Always nagging me.

39
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,240
Mother's away.

40
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,280
Can't I play a little longer?

41
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:59,560
Please listen to us, Your Highness!

42
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,120
Don't play with dangerous things.

43
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,520
If anything happened to you,

44
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,240
a hundred lives wouldn't
make up for it.

45
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,680
All right, all right.

46
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,320
So annoying!

47
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:08,840
Don't move.

48
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,640
Stay right there.

49
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:22,920
Your Highness!

50
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,080
Oh no!

51
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,120
We're doomed!

52
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:28,000
Noble Consort Hui will beat us to death.

53
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,040
I'll get the physician.

54
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:30,920
Silence!

55
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,240
No physician.

56
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,280
Back to the palace.

57
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:38,720
Your Highness.

58
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,800
The second prince was hurt,
but they won't call a physician.

59
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,760
Why is that?

60
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,080
(They must be hiding something.)

61
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:48,000
(Could there be something wrong)

62
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,920
(with his parentage?)

63
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:57,920
Mother.

64
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,400
It hurts.

65
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,600
You're so frail.

66
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,600
Even a small wound takes ages to heal.

67
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,080
I have them follow you everywhere

68
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,680
so you wouldn't get hurt.

69
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,600
Be more careful from now on.

70
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,880
Do you understand?

71
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,280
Yes, Mother.

72
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,640
Go on.

73
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,000
Get some rest.

74
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,760
How many times must I tell you?

75
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,880
You must watch the second prince
with utmost care!

76
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:32,720
Calm down, Your Highness.

77
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:33,840
We were wrong.

78
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,960
We'll watch him more closely
from now on.

79
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,360
But the imperial garden
was nearly empty today.

80
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:39,960
No one should have noticed.

81
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,080
Your Highness.

82
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,640
I've learned something

83
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,080
about Zhaoyi Rong.

84
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:48,960
What is it?

85
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,840
Before entering the palace,

86
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,520
she was treated poorly by her family.

87
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,720
Her parents favored sons over daughters.

88
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,520
They were greedy.

89
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,920
Zhaoyi Rong never wanted to
enter the palace.

90
00:03:57,960 --> 00:04:00,240
But her parents threatened
her grandmother's life.

91
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,960
So she agreed to enter
the palace as a candidate.

92
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:04,360
Your Highness.

93
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,600
In that case,

94
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:08,280
why not use her parents to get to her?

95
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,520
I see.

96
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,880
Fu Rong has a weakness too.

97
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:34,800
Yes, Your Highness.

98
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,360
Your Highness.

99
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,680
Your Highness.

100
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,640
Are you still in pain?

101
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,600
The physician...

102
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,560
Why hasn't he come yet?

103
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,800
When you went to fetch Physician Li,

104
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,440
what did he say?

105
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,800
He said he wasn't on duty today.

106
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,480
And Physician Wang would come

107
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,840
once he finishes the consultation.

108
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,440
Your Highness.

109
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:01,920
I'll...

110
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,120
I'll go ask again.

111
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,200
No need.

112
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,000
He's deliberately avoiding me.

113
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,880
Then, Your Highness...

114
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,160
Your Highness.

115
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,920
Your pulse is rapid and slippery.

116
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:36,280
These are signs of poisoning.

117
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:37,520
Did you take cinnabar or

118
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,960
a potent substance like
mirabilite by mistake?

119
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,520
Cinnabar?

120
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,680
Why would you poison yourself?

121
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,680
Here's an antidote.

122
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,080
Take it.

123
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,080
Drink plenty of warm water
within half an hour

124
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,040
to flush out the poison.

125
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,840
Cinnabar is cold and toxic.

126
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,920
Too much can damage your organs.

127
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,960
In severe cases, it can be fatal.

128
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,080
Why would you do this?

129
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,320
To see you, of course.

130
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:57,720
You went to such lengths,

131
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,720
even poisoning yourself,

132
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,320
just for what?

133
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:04,440
I have questions no outsider can hear.

134
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,320
Only you can answer them.

135
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:09,440
But you kept avoiding me.

136
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,960
Every time I needed a diagnosis,

137
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:13,400
you sent someone else instead.

138
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:16,240
I had no other choice.

139
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,720
What would you like to ask?

140
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,320
If someone has

141
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,040
a small wound,

142
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,240
but won't stop bleeding,

143
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,360
and the blood won't clot,

144
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,680
what could be the cause?

145
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,480
What you describe

146
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,280
is a blood disorder.

147
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,920
The blood cannot clot properly.

148
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,280
Once bleeding begins, it's hard to stop.

149
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,520
Even a slight bump

150
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:43,960
could cause severe bleeding.

151
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:46,320
In serious cases, it can be fatal.

152
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,800
Does it run in the family?

153
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:49,920
Exactly.

154
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,280
It's often inherited.

155
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:53,080
Does His Majesty have it?

156
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,600
His Majesty is in good health.

157
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:55,680
He has no such condition.

158
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,320
I see.

159
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,760
If you have more questions,

160
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:03,920
or need me to explain anything,

161
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,280
just send word.

162
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,760
Don't hurt yourself again.

163
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,360
Take your medicine on time to detox.

164
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:10,560
I'll take my leave.

165
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,360
Chunli.

166
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,200
See Physician Li out.

167
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,280
Yes.

168
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,480
(So everyone in Chengxi Palace)

169
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,760
(is hiding the blood disorder
of the second prince.)

170
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,680
(Noble Consort Hui.)

171
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:32,240
(I've found your secret.)

172
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,760
(You shamed the harem)

173
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:35,520
(and bore a child of shame.)

174
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,640
(You tainted the imperial bloodline.)

175
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:40,440
(Could it be...)

176
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,440
(That day, Lingxi was killed)

177
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:45,680
(because she discovered
this terrible secret?)

178
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,120
Your Highness.

179
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:17,280
The Imperial Household
sent over some Lushan silk today.

180
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:19,480
I find it elegant and refined.

181
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:21,200
It suits your temperament.

182
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:24,320
I'll have Yinshuang pick some tomorrow
and bring them to your palace

183
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,760
for new robes.

184
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,840
His Majesty will be pleased.

185
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,680
Thank you.

186
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,520
Your Highness.

187
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,920
I'm late.

188
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,200
Please forgive me.

189
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,160
Rise.

190
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,280
Come, have a seat.

191
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:51,960
I heard His Majesty summoned you
last night.

192
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,800
He stayed until after breakfast.

193
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,680
Why would I blame you?

194
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:58,880
Concubine Rou, your fragrance...

195
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,040
It's so lovely.

196
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,880
No wonder His Majesty likes it.

197
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,400
You flatterer.

198
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,960
Don't tease me like that.

199
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:08,040
I only used a little pearl powder.

200
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,000
If you like it,

201
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:12,960
I'll have Jinxiu send over a few boxes.

202
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,440
Thank you, Your Highness.

203
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:15,720
Try some.

204
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:19,440
This year's Lushan ginkgo tea.

205
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:20,480
It's wonderfully sweet.

206
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,280
Go on, try it.

207
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:25,320
(A few days ago,)

208
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,920
(His Majesty gave Noble Consort Hui)

209
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:30,000
(a pot of golden gardenias from Shunan.)

210
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:32,120
(It's the only one in the harem.)

211
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,640
(Its scent is delicate.)

212
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,520
(The fragrance on Concubine Rou...)

213
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:37,040
(It's clearly gardenia.)

214
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,240
(Yet she says it's pearl powder.)

215
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,240
(Concubine Rou.)

216
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,800
(Whose side are you on?)

217
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,520
Your Highness, this chess manual...

218
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:53,320
It took every effort I had

219
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,640
to get it.

220
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:57,640
Well done.

221
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,800
This is for you.

222
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:00,680
Thank you, Your Highness.

223
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:02,720
Just call on me anytime.

224
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:19,560
(Concubine Rou has quite
a few tricks of her own.)

225
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,320
It seems the poison has worn off.

226
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,360
Physician Li.

227
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,800
It's so late.

228
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,480
Why are you still in the harem?

229
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,400
I was fetching a calming remedy
for the Empress Dowager.

230
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,640
On my way out,

231
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,560
I saw you sneaking after Concubine Rou.

232
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:38,280
What are you plotting?

233
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:42,680
You caught me so easily.

234
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:43,560
I suppose

235
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:45,560
I'll have to be more careful next time.

236
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,520
Fu Rong.

237
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,960
Don't you understand?

238
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,120
Must you risk your life before

239
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,120
you'll be satisfied?

240
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,320
What happened to you?

241
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,800
Good question.

242
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,240
I used to seek no power or favor.

243
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:10,480
I only wanted to spend my life with you.

244
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,320
But my family

245
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:14,320
wouldn't let me choose my own path.

246
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,280
All because I was a woman.

247
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:19,040
They said,

248
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:22,000
a woman shouldn't have
wishes of her own.

249
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:24,440
A woman's only purpose in life

250
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:26,240
was to marry well

251
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:29,560
and serve as a tool
for her family to seek profit.

252
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,760
After entering the palace,
I wanted to die.

253
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,160
I wanted to be free.

254
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,280
But then I had Lingxi.

255
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,400
She gave me a reason to live again.

256
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:46,080
I gave her everything I had.

257
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,600
I wanted her

258
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:51,320
to have a different life from mine.

259
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:53,320
I wanted her to grow up
under my protection,

260
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,600
free to be herself,

261
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:57,040
and live a happy, fulfilling life.

262
00:12:57,880 --> 00:12:58,440
But...

263
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:04,960
I never got the chance.

264
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,840
Just because Lingxi was a girl,

265
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:12,840
a disabled child,

266
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,720
they could torment her

267
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,040
and take her life at will.

268
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,400
How dare they?

269
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:22,080
I swear...

270
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:24,560
Everyone

271
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:27,640
who played a part in Lingxi's death

272
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,640
will go to hell.

273
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:33,560
If you're still the Li Chengyan
I once knew,

274
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:35,880
the man who understood me,

275
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:37,560
then stop trying to dissuade me.

276
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:40,680
Just watch from a distance.

277
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,280
This time,

278
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:45,000
I'll be myself.

279
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,800
I'll give my life

280
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:48,720
to burn away

281
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,920
the filth of this harem.

282
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:53,760
I'll burn through the foulness behind

283
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,240
these palace walls.

284
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,520
(Chengxi Palace)

285
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,560
Your Highness.

286
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:30,400
Rise.

287
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:33,680
Your Highness.

288
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,760
I'm all prepared.

289
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:41,480
You truly are decisive.

290
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,960
The next show

291
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:44,560
is yours.

292
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:45,560
Your Highness.

293
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:47,160
I'm putting myself at risk.

294
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,080
If anything goes wrong,

295
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,640
His Majesty could have me killed.

296
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:55,480
Concubine Rou.

297
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,160
When your maternal family was convicted,

298
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:01,280
your mother, the only daughter
of the Marquis of Zhenyuan,

299
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:02,640
was stripped of her title

300
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,560
and exiled.

301
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,120
You've struggled in this palace
for years,

302
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,520
yet your rank never rose.

303
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:10,520
All because your mother
is still branded a criminal.

304
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,360
You're a devoted daughter.

305
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:13,920
This time,

306
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,720
I'll grant your wish.

307
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,520
Your Highness,

308
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,240
will you keep your word?

309
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,960
My father oversees
the Ministry of Justice.

310
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:25,040
Court of Judicial Review and
the Court of Censors all have my kin.

311
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:27,040
One word from me,

312
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:29,240
and they'll pull strings

313
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,800
to clear your mother's name

314
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,880
and lift her status as a convict.

315
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:41,000
If Your Highness keeps your word,

316
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:42,920
I'll die with no regrets.

317
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,320
I'll send someone to handle it tomorrow.

318
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:48,080
But listen carefully.

319
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:52,560
I want the eldest prince to grow bold

320
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,120
and shameless enough

321
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,680
to covet His Majesty's consorts.

322
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,480
Can you do it?

323
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:05,240
As you command.

324
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:13,640
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

325
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:18,680
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

326
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:23,480
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

327
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:28,320
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

328
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:33,080
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

329
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:38,120
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

330
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:42,920
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

331
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:47,880
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

332
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:52,640
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

333
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:56,080
♪Let the stars and sea♪

334
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:57,580
(Changsheng Gate)

335
00:16:57,580 --> 00:17:01,400
♪Wait for your return♪
